WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
And it was also a historic victory against human trafficking

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.780
throughout the region. What we did was a victory.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.460
And we saved so many lives of people

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.060
that wouldn't make the journey.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.580
That journey was loaded up with death.

